{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20346","headline":"怀友 · 张籍","name":"怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生有行役，谁能如草木。\n别离感中怀，乃爲我桎梏。\n百年受命短，光景良不足。\n念我别离者，愿怀日月促。\n平地施道路，车马往不复。\n空知爲良田，秋望禾黍熟。\n端居无俦侣，日夜祷耳目。\n立身难自觉，常恐忧与辱。\n穷贱无闲暇，疾痛多嗜欲。\n我思携手人，逍遥任心腹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}